  "name": "Sentinel Fighting",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While wielding a melee weapon with which you are proficient, you can use a Bonus Action to enter a defensive stance until the start of your next turn. While in this stance, you can make a number of Opportunity Attacks equal to your Proficiency Bonus without using your Reaction, and you can use your Reaction to attack a creature that moves more than 5 feet while within your reach.</p>",
